iotrowski and Peter Whewell, our second and fourth scorers. (Photos:R. Linstead)","id":"B165-40","w":"March 1968"},{"f":"crops/B168/B168-p13-bicourt-piotrowski-steeplechase.jpg","c":"TOP LEFT: John Bicourt and Dick Piotrowski lead the steeplechase field.","id":"B168-18","w":"December 1968"},{"f":"crops/B168/B168-p19-oconnor-leads-5-75.jpg","c":"Pat O'Connor leads from Alan Black, Dick Piotrowski and Roger Donnison","id":"B168-23","w":"December 1968"},{"f":"crops/B169/B169-p31-mann-leads-piotrowski.jpg","c":"Lionel Mann leads Dick Piotrowski","id":"B169-71","w":"March 1969"},{"f":"crops/B170/B170-p02-hart-piotrowski-national-relay.jpg","c":"FRONTISPIECE: (Ron Linstead) BELGRAVE take \"Silver\" in the National Relay at Leicester, and here is Trevor Hart handing over to Dick Piotrowski at the end of stage 8, in third place and 47 seconds behind the ultimate winners, Coventry Godiva.","id":"B170-02","w":"June 1969"},{"f":"crops/B170/B170-p33-national-league-action.jpg","c":"PHOTO ACTION AT NATIONAL LEAGUE. TOP LEFT: Dick Piotrowski heads for a ducking in the S/chase, but surfaced to go on to finish 3rd. in 9:30.8 TOP RIGHT: In the 'B' S/chase Alan Black sets the pace and also secured 3rd. position. BOTTOM LEFT: Adrian Major runs at the shoulder of Don Faircloth (Croydon) in the 'A' 5000 metres before he too finished 3rd. BOTTOM RIGHT: In the 'B' 5000 metres Laurie O'Hara proved too good for most of the second strings and he is seen here finishing 2nd.","id":"B170-56","w":"June 1969"},{"f":"crops/B171/B171-p32-fairclough-ohara-piotrowski.jpg","c":"Fairclough, O'Hara and Piotrowski are all set for some fast road times","id":"B171-57","w":"September 1969"},{"f":"crops/B172/B172-p15-johnston-relay-winning-team.jpg","c":"THE WINNING \"JOHNSTONE\" TEAM (Photo:David Hart)\nBACK ROW(l.to.r.):G.Biscoe(Manager),A.Fairclough(Reserve),R.Piotrowski,L.O'Hara,P.Morris, P.O'Connor.\nFRONT ROW(l.to.r.):G.W.Dance,J.Thresher,Gerry North(Captain),Geoff North,T.Hart.\nNote:L. Mann is absent--under escort back to the Palace!.","id":"B172-30","w":"December 1969"},{"f":"crops/B172/B172-p18-north-brothers-piotrowski-5-3-4.jpg","c":"Dick Piotrowski and Gerry North (left) chase Geoff North during the '5¾'. Dick fell back at four miles leaving Gerry to finish second, 27 secs down on his brother.\nPhoto:Ron Linstead.","id":"B172-33","w":"December 1969"},{"f":"crops/B226/B226-p06-xc-championship-1968.jpg","c":"Lionel leads Bob Smith, Dick Piotrowski, and Adrian Major during the Belgrave 7½ miles Cross Country Championship of 1968 but all four had to give way to Tony Fairclough (1st), Laurie O'Hara (2nd) and Pat O'Connor (3rd) by the finish. The field was 36 strong.","id":"B226-12","w":"March 1998"}],"photo":{"file":"crops/B165/B165-p21-piotrowski-whewell-south-of-thames.jpg","caption":"Dick Piotrowski and Peter Whewell, our second and fourth scorers. (Photos:R. Linstead)","source":"B165-40","when":"March 1968"},"slarchive":"https://slarchive.org/#athlete/dick-piotrowski","slRaces":6,"x":1,"legend":false}